"为什么健康数据为空？" = "Why is my health data empty?";
"HealthKit 无法向应用区分“拒绝读取”和“没有样本”。请在系统健康权限中检查，并确认健康 App 内已有对应数据。" = "HealthKit cannot tell the app apart \"read denied\" and \"no samples\". Check the system health permissions and confirm the data exists in the Health app.";
"为什么运动没有路线？" = "Why doesn't a workout have a route?";
"Apple 健康样本不一定包含可读取路线；MoveFit 户外运动还要求使用期间定位权限和有效定位点。" = "Apple Health samples do not always include a readable route; MoveFit outdoor workouts also require while-in-use location permission and valid locations.";
"为什么账号无法绑定？" = "Why can't an account be linked?";
"请先确认已登录，再到“账号绑定”页刷新；第三方授权或服务端未配置时不会伪造绑定。" = "Confirm you are signed in first, then refresh on the Account bindings page; bindings are never fabricated when provider authorization or the server is unconfigured.";
"动作库来自哪里？" = "Where does the exercise catalog come from?";
"优先读取动作目录后端；服务不可达时才显示随应用发布并审核的基础动作。" = "The exercise catalog backend is read first; bundled, reviewed basic exercises appear only when it is unreachable.";
"重试读取服务端帮助" = "Retry server help";
"排查步骤" = "Troubleshooting";
"1. 检查系统设置中的健康与定位权限" = "1. Check Health and Location permissions in system Settings";
"2. 回到应用的“健康与设备”点击刷新" = "2. Go back to the app's Health and devices page and tap refresh";
"3. 确认设备时间、时区和健康 App 样本日期" = "3. Confirm device time, time zone and sample dates in the Health app";
"4. 仍有问题时记录系统版本、机型和操作步骤，不要附带健康明细或精确路线" = "4. If problems persist, note the OS version, device model and steps; never include health details or precise routes";
