"MoveFit 隐私政策" = "MoveFit privacy policy";
"更新日期：2026 年 8 月 8 日" = "Updated: August 8, 2026";
"数据处理原则" = "Data processing principles";
"MoveFit 以本机处理为默认方式，只读取实现用户主动使用功能所必需的数据，不出售个人信息，不投放基于健康数据的广告。" = "MoveFit processes on-device by default and reads only the data required by features you actively use; no selling of personal information and no health-data-based advertising.";
"经用户授权后，应用读取活动、心率、睡眠与运动样本用于界面展示和本地规则计算。原始健康样本保留在 HealthKit；应用不会自动批量上传 HealthKit 样本。" = "After authorization the app reads activity, heart rate, sleep and workout samples for display and local rule computation. Raw samples stay in HealthKit; the app never bulk-uploads HealthKit samples.";
"位置与运动" = "Location and workouts";
"户外运动期间可读取前台位置，用于计算距离与绘制路线。完成的 MoveFit 运动及路线保存在本机 Core Data。应用不申请始终定位。" = "While-in-use location is read during outdoor workouts to compute distance and draw routes. Completed MoveFit workouts and routes are stored in on-device Core Data. The app never requests always-on location.";
"身体指标与偏好" = "Body metrics and preferences";
"昵称、身高、体重、体脂、挑战参与、收藏、外观、语言和隐私遮挡偏好保存在本机；登录后资料与 MoveFit 运动记录会同步到服务端。访问令牌只保存在设备 Keychain。" = "Nickname, height, weight, body fat, challenge participation, favorites, appearance, language and privacy-hiding preferences stay on device; after sign-in, profile and MoveFit workouts sync to the server. Access tokens are stored only in the device Keychain.";
"账号与第三方" = "Account and third parties";
"邮箱或手机号密码认证会向主业务后端发送账号标识，令牌仅存于 Keychain。Apple 与 Google 授权登录已启用；微信授权需另行配置 SDK，未配置时不会产生模拟绑定。" = "Email or phone password authentication sends the account identifier to the main backend; tokens live only in the Keychain. Apple and Google authorization are enabled; WeChat requires its SDK and never fabricates bindings when unconfigured.";
"保留与删除" = "Retention and deletion";
"可重建缓存可在应用内清理。卸载应用会移除应用沙盒数据，但不会删除 HealthKit 中由其他应用或设备产生的样本。" = "Rebuildable caches can be cleared in the app. Uninstalling removes app-sandbox data but never samples in HealthKit produced by other apps or devices.";
"安全与日志" = "Security and logs";
"应用日志不得包含姓名、联系方式、精确位置、健康指标、访问令牌或完整服务响应。" = "App logs must never contain names, contact details, precise location, health metrics, access tokens or full server responses.";
"联系我们" = "Contact";
"当前版本通过项目仓库的问题渠道接收反馈。请勿在反馈中提交个人健康、账号或定位数据。" = "Feedback goes through the project repository issue channel; never include personal health, account or location data.";
